          <h1><span class="lm"><span style="--ld:.05s">Keep the <span class="green">Forest</span></span></span><span class="lm"><span style="--ld:.18s">Standing.</span></span></h1>
          <p class="hero-sub" data-rv style="--d:.16s">Rimba is a small conservation foundation working with villages in West Kalimantan and Central Java. We rewet burned peatland, replant eroding mangrove coasts, and pay local crews to guard both. Then we publish what survives.</p>
          <form class="email-bar" id="heroForm" novalidate data-rv style="--d:.24s">
